596
01:16:38,939 --> 01:16:40,492
- Uno...
-Oh...

597
01:16:40,596 --> 01:16:42,908
- ...cadáver.
- ...Dios mío.

598
01:16:43,012 --> 01:16:44,600
Nuestro.

599
01:16:44,703 --> 01:16:45,980
Berta.

600
01:16:46,084 --> 01:16:48,086
¿Qué carajo?

601
